WEBVTT

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:55.400
Dragon Ball Z.

00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:57.940
Androids have arrived.

00:01:58.570 --> 00:01:59.990
And these merciless machi-

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.700
are unleashing their fury upon a city of unsuspecting citizens.

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:07.820
Their diabolical deeds locking this bustling metropolis

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:09.720
in a stranglehold of terror.

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:20.620
Yamcha's on the lookout, and he's more than ready to spring into action against these terrible new enemies.

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:22.500
But watch out, Yamcha.

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:26.240
Because it looks like the androids have their evil eyes set on you.

00:02:26.320 --> 00:02:26.800
Excellent.

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:31.480
You two better be careful.

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:34.920
There's a couple of androids on the loose and they mean business.

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:38.400
All day.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:45.040
Try as he might.

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:48.260
Yamcha is no match for the Android's awesome power.

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:53.510
And all of his struggles can do nothing to prevent even greater destruction from raining down.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:09.500
Now, as the city crumbles around him, separated from his friends, Yamcha finds himself staring into the face of evil.

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:18.240
Anything free him from the android's sinister grasp?

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:22.120
Will Goku and the others arrive to help their friend in time?

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:23.570
Find out.

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:25.000
On today's episode.

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:27.230
of Dragon Ball Z!

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:29.880
Raining but who's I think

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:31.970
I think that's Yamcha!

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:34.060
I've got to hurry!

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:11.580
Oh no, Yamcha!

00:05:39.510 --> 00:05:42.560
Krillin, listen! There's still a chance to save him!

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:45.780
Take him back to Bulma and give him one of the Sensu beans!

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:47.740
Go now! As fast as you can!

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:48.750
I'm on it!

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:21.050
On you Krillin

00:06:21.720 --> 00:06:21.940
Right

00:06:38.510 --> 00:06:40.570
So these are the big bad androids.

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:42.530
Kind of funny looking if you ask me.

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:47.190
Well now, I find it surprising

00:06:47.190 --> 00:06:49.530
that you should know we are androids.

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:54.140
Of course, I find it even more surprising

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:55.880
that all of you should have anticipated

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:57.980
our arrival on this island.

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:03.900
Tell me, how did you know we would come?

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:08.820
If you're so tough, why don't you try to make us?

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:11.170
Very well.

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:32.730
There's way too many innocent people around here.

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:35.160
We've got to lead these two out of the city.

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:35.780
Yes.

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:36.080
Huh?

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:40.030
It is too crowded here.

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:41.640
I agree.

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:44.460
Many people could get in our way.

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:47.820
I will see to it that they do not.

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:48.680
Huh?

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:05.540
Oh my gosh!

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:07.550
Did the androids do that?

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:08.940
Thank you.

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:14.560
them alright.

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:18.720
It looks like they just blew up half the city.

00:09:19.930 --> 00:09:21.070
Yeah, no kidding.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:27.240
Just don't know how we're going to stop them you guys. I hope Goku knows what to do

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:28.680
Thank you.

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:42.700
You monster!

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:53.440
I cleared the area of innocence in accordance with your wishes.

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:57.280
Do you disagree with my methods?

00:09:58.400 --> 00:09:58.900
Leave!

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:15.110
people out of this very well you may lead us to another place of your choosing

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:23.550
Goku huh how did you know his name was Goku I know all of you the Namek Piccolo

00:10:23.550 --> 00:10:25.670
and even you the one named Jen

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:44.120
Let's get acquainted later, Bean!

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:56.360
And the androids!

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:56.680
Huh?

00:10:57.910 --> 00:10:59.880
Go get them away from the city!

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:00.980
We'll be right back.

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:01.480
Oh, no!

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:03.750
We've got to warn him somehow, you guys!

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:06.750
He doesn't know the androids can absorb his energy!

00:11:07.990 --> 00:11:08.290
What?

00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:39.430
Come on, girl!

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:40.670
Go, girl, go!

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:42.270
What? What?

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:44.750
This is right!

00:11:45.090 --> 00:11:45.610
Woo!

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:02.040
of Sezbo on Menbo Island,

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:04.120
nine miles southwest of Stealth City,

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:06.420
has been rocked by a devastating explosion,

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:08.360
the causes of which are still unknown.

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:10.500
The News 8 copter is on its way to the sea...

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.740
Was that nine miles southwest of South City?

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:14.360
Huh? Master Osh?

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:17.910
It's the place where Tien went.

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:20.720
I know. I didn't want to believe it,

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:23.600
but it looks like that boy from the future was right.

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:26.560
Communication City has been cut off,

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:28.780
and so far, there are no reports on casualties.

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:29.900
Oh, no.

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:34.820
I wouldn't worry about it, son. I'm sure Tien is fine.

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:38.400
Those boys know how to take care of themselves, wouldn't you say, Oolong?

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:41.580
Sure they do. And on top of that, Goku's there,

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:44.460
and he's pretty much the strongest guy in the whole world.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.060
Yeah, I guess you're right.

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:52.630
Well, Goku, once again, we're all counting on you.

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:42.620
Yamcha, I don't get it. You said the androids could absorb powers?

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:46.880
I don't know how we did it, but when the android grabbed me,

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:49.960
I could feel all the energy being drained from my body.

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:52.550
Well, what in the world are you waiting for?

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:55.970
Get moving before those nasty androids grab someone else.

00:13:56.550 --> 00:13:58.450
Oh, no. There's no time to lose.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:13:59.970
Come on, we've got to warn my dad.

00:14:01.720 --> 00:14:04.520
I'm not so sure I want to go back down there, Gohan.

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:07.760
I mean, I almost bit the big one last time.

00:14:08.020 --> 00:14:09.340
Maybe I should stay here.

00:14:10.470 --> 00:14:11.430
Hey, Gohan!

00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:14.470
You stay here, then, but I've got to help.

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:16.060
I'm taking the sensu beans.

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:21.400
Those two don't have the foggiest idea what they're up against.

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:24.000
And I know what those androids can do.

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:29.520
No, I won't let what happened to me happen to anyone else.

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:33.000
I've got to help my friends.

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:34.520
Wait up, guys!

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:35.240
I'm coming!

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:47.600
I'm just dumber than he looks.

00:14:48.230 --> 00:14:54.180
You mean you're not going to go with them?

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:56.070
Not on your life, babe.

00:14:57.110 --> 00:14:59.810
And why not, from what I hear, Yajirobe?

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:02.840
You're a pretty good fighter, and they need all the help they can get.

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:06.610
So I suggest you quit being a coward and get yourself into gear.

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:07.930
Can't do it.

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:10.560
I am tired of hearing your lame excuses.

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:12.860
Get down there and help out your buddies now.

00:15:13.980 --> 00:15:15.800
I don't know how to fly, Bulma.

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:16.660
Huh?

00:15:57.870 --> 00:15:58.990
I'm beginning to grow impatient.

00:15:59.680 --> 00:15:59.980
Where are...

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.030
Are you bling us?

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:09.320
Very well, this is far enough.

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:18.000
I have decided for you.

00:16:18.250 --> 00:16:19.370
We will fight here.

00:16:47.470 --> 00:16:49.030
Why did he pick this spot?

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:55.270
High ground surrounded by rocky outcrops.

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:58.830
That could mean they're thinking of using these rocks as cover.

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:05.020
We mustn't underestimate them, you guys.

00:17:07.910 --> 00:17:11.830
Before we get this little show started, I want to know how you knew our names.

00:17:17.320 --> 00:17:19.630
With Goku? Why is he out of breath?

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:22.880
Couldn't have used up that much energy just flying here.

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:34.880
Yes, of course, as you wish.

00:17:35.060 --> 00:17:38.460
Though I doubt it will matter much to you after a few moments

00:17:38.460 --> 00:17:41.100
when you have been ground to a pulp.

00:17:41.550 --> 00:17:44.970
But if this is the last thing you wish to hear before you die,

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:46.710
I will tell you,

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:51.620
you have been under close observation for some time

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:54.950
by a highly sophisticated remote tracking device.

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:59.960
This device was calibrated...

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.760
hone in on your very distinct energy pattern

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:06.500
and was planted on you during the World Martial Arts Tournament

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:08.080
when you were still a boy.

00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:13.620
From that day forward, your every movement was monitored.

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:15.780
Your fighting techniques studied.

00:18:16.170 --> 00:18:19.820
The secrets of your Kamehameha wave revealed.

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:24.130
Over the years, Dr. Giroux followed your many battles.

00:18:24.510 --> 00:18:27.750
He witnessed your skills develop at a remarkable rate.

00:18:28.220 --> 00:18:29.980
He watched as your power soared.

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:33.600
to astounding new heights, and by watching, he learned.

00:18:34.350 --> 00:18:37.030
You were studied until Dr. Giroux had gathered

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:40.210
enough information to create the perfect fighting machine.

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:41.740
Powerful machines.

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:45.060
Machines fully capable of destroying you,

00:18:45.280 --> 00:18:47.900
the way you destroyed the Red Ribbon Army.

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:50.280
This is just a grudge?

00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:53.420
From the day you defeated the Red Ribbon Army,

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:55.760
Dr. Giroux dreamed only of revenge.

00:18:56.220 --> 00:18:58.240
We will realize his dream.

00:18:58.580 --> 00:18:59.980
So you're supposed to be one.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:02.620
One of these perfect fighting machines, I take it.

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:04.470
Yes, I am.

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:09.700
I have been designed by my creator to be superior to you in every possible way.

00:19:10.430 --> 00:19:12.990
A shame he could not live to see this day.

00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:14.520
I'm curious.

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:18.020
Was he spying on me while I was fighting on planet Namek?

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:19.580
There was no more need.

00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:24.720
By that time, Dr. Giroux had compiled all of the necessary information concerning your skills.

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:29.710
It was assumed that your power would continue to increase over time.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:33.380
So that increase was calculated and factored into our designs.

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:49.400
Are they? By the time anyone has a reason to crank up their power level to where I can find it, it'll probably be too late!

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:07.760
You might think you know everything there is to know about me, but really?

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:09.510
You're not even close.

00:20:10.260 --> 00:20:10.500
Hmm?

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:12.500
Your calculations.

00:20:13.240 --> 00:20:16.220
Did they predict that Goku would be a Super Saiyan?

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:17.560
Super Saiyan?

00:21:18.780 --> 00:21:19.060
What do you say?

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:20.260
It's spectacular!

00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:24.580
Piccolo and Tien, you stay out of this.

00:21:24.890 --> 00:21:28.250
It looks like they only want me, and that's exactly who they'll get.

00:21:34.630 --> 00:21:37.830
This is a most unexpected development, indeed.

00:21:39.910 --> 00:21:43.090
This technique is not listed in my files, Twenty.

00:21:43.850 --> 00:21:44.750
nor in mine.

00:21:45.090 --> 00:21:47.890
But my senses indicate that there is no cause for concern.

00:21:48.940 --> 00:21:51.860
Yes, it is a most impressive ability.

00:21:52.490 --> 00:21:54.890
But it is nothing we cannot handle.

00:21:55.300 --> 00:21:57.640
Nineteen will demonstrate this by himself.

00:22:03.580 --> 00:22:03.900
Huh!

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:08.040
All right, have it your way, but I wouldn't bank on it if I were you.

00:22:08.910 --> 00:22:09.190
Grrrr!

00:22:09.550 --> 00:22:09.830
Grrrr!

00:22:09.830 --> 00:22:09.850
Grrrr!

00:22:09.850 --> 00:22:09.890
Grrrr!

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:10.070
Grrrr!

00:22:14.970 --> 00:22:18.150
At long last, the battle for the future has finally begun.

00:22:18.940 --> 00:22:21.340
But can even Goku's Super Saiyan strength

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:23.760
stand up for the awesome power of the androids?

00:22:23.940 --> 00:22:26.040
You won't want to miss a single second

00:22:26.040 --> 00:22:27.360
of the heart-stopping action.

00:22:27.670 --> 00:22:29.970
in the next exciting episode of...

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:31.160
Dragon Ball Z.

00:23:06.040 --> 00:23:06.240
Shut up.

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:34.330
Thank you for watching!

